ffs are a powerful tool than can grant a piece a unique advantage on the board or in combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/42161b8454845c8712bf5c88133f30bb.avif?t=1692123578\" /></span><br><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/46803e5d5672a167b5cc4555c9d969f0.webp?t=1692123578\" /></span><br><br>\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/9310fa5a1d2fd668b701a35baf515910.poster.avif?t=1692123578\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/9310fa5a1d2fd668b701a35baf515910.webm?t=1692123578\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/9310fa5a1d2fd668b701a35baf515910.mp4?t=1692123578\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...and Conquer.</h2>In combat, each piece has access to two unique attacks. Learning how pieces counter one another in combat is vital to exploiting your opponent's weaknesses. Damage pieces take in battle carries over afterward. So even if a battle seems hopeless, you can endeavor to weaken your opponent's piece.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/dc85bd04f2ea570bbf507fb5c0509fc7.avif?t=1692123578\" /></span><br><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/46803e5d5672a167b5cc4555c9d969f0.webp?t=1692123578\" /></span><br><br><strong>Key Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unique blend of turn-based tactics and real-time dueling action.<br></li><li>Engage in intense 1v1 battles against skilled opponents.<br></li><li>Harness strategic thinking and plan your moves carefully.<br></li><li>Enhance your pieces with Buffs <br></li><li>Stop foes in their tracks with traps and hazards<br></li><li>Hire new pieces to aid you in battle from a colorful cast of characters<br></li><li>Defeat the enemy Wyrm and climb the leaderboard in your conquest to be the True King of Wyrms</li></ul><br>Prepare to unleash your tactical brilliance and combat prowess in Wyrmicide. Will you crush your foes, claim victory, and become the One True Wyrm King?<br><br>\u2800\u2800\u2800<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2473470/extras/46803e5d5672a167b5cc4555c9d969f0.webp?t=1692123578\" /></span>",
